{"v":4,"catch":"繫好安全帶！","desc":"《Minit Fun Racer》是一款蘊含奇妙趣味的小型賽車遊戲，開發者與 Devolver 的利潤都將全數捐作慈善，未來也一直都會是如此。\n\n騎上摩托車，在熱鬧擁擠的城市街頭奔馳，並前往到處都是廢墟殘骸的荒蕪沙漠，欣賞落日夕陽的餘暉。與當地的商店老闆交朋友、搶硬幣、飛躍而起，並在每一個賽圈完成有趣的目標，直到你體驗到所有的精彩遊戲內容為止！\n\n《Minit Fun Racer》由 Kitty Calis、Jan Willem Nijman、Jukio Kallio 和 Dominik Johann 等人合力開發。","publisher":"Devolver Digital","release":"2023-05-03","genres":["競速","街機","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["西班牙文","葡萄牙文","英文","法文","德文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5984a505a99db005ef478f1bfd0ee447c1d4cb3a297a00cc87eec8695c7f8d0d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/413bf420a81cbe3d595ee9d53a054486a3d8fadc735edea747902e8252985c5e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f8fb00fda29348456c8e6e21a2061c65b2f1616b39d3be8986f92138771feb83.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f6217dd4e63a5d5e28ef78ef8a3c866d337d8a6f491c5894e1ce31e0b74e59e1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/31a22e33976ab7628c7f958e14e74c33ef8263247e3e2c1cf950220326fce424.jpg"],"titleId":"0100862019f68000","dlc":[]}